WEBVTT

01:33.290 --> 01:35.561
(Adapted from the web novel "Waiting for You in a City")

01:35.621 --> 01:37.921
(Fireworks of My Heart)

01:37.990 --> 01:40.891
(Episode 33)

01:46.600 --> 01:48.070
The ultimate technique.

01:48.141 --> 01:49.141
Don't worry.

01:50.841 --> 01:52.410
Right away.

01:52.841 --> 01:54.011
Not yet.

01:54.841 --> 01:56.410
Look, not bad.

01:57.111 --> 01:58.581
- Mom. - Is this taking a passive beating?

01:59.210 --> 02:00.511
- Ma'am. - Ms. Fu.

02:03.350 --> 02:05.221
How is your dad?

02:05.421 --> 02:06.290
He's good.

02:06.350 --> 02:07.650
He even went to play basketball two days ago.

02:08.361 --> 02:09.460
How have you been?

02:09.520 --> 02:10.460
I'm fine.

02:10.520 --> 02:11.261
You guys play first.

02:11.331 --> 02:12.091
I'll check on the food.

02:12.160 --> 02:13.061
- Okay. - All right, Mrs. Meng.

02:14.930 --> 02:15.800
Let's continue.

02:23.800 --> 02:24.870
This is a big move.

02:26.770 --> 02:27.441
Qin Qin.

02:28.280 --> 02:29.180
I heard...

02:29.240 --> 02:30.411
that you're...

02:30.481 --> 02:31.780
with that firefighter?

02:34.280 --> 02:36.520
I think I saw him earlier.

02:36.851 --> 02:38.050
But I wasn't sure.

02:40.090 --> 02:42.161
I saw him when I was entering the neighborhood earlier.

02:42.460 --> 02:43.460
He was waiting outside.

02:43.761 --> 02:44.731
I think he was waiting for you.

02:46.990 --> 02:48.361
Won't Mrs. Meng let him in?

02:49.960 --> 02:50.761
Did you say...

02:51.530 --> 02:52.331
he's standing outside?

02:53.370 --> 02:54.101
Yes.

02:54.430 --> 02:55.300
This neighborhood is so remote.

02:55.370 --> 02:56.270
And there's no shop.

02:56.400 --> 02:57.270
There's only one museum...

02:57.340 --> 02:58.671
and it's closed due to renovation.

02:59.571 --> 03:00.641
The food is here.

03:01.611 --> 03:02.280
Coming.

03:02.581 --> 03:03.541
Let me help you.

03:03.611 --> 03:05.081
Okay, thank you.

03:06.851 --> 03:07.710
Kids.

03:07.851 --> 03:08.620
Let's eat.

03:10.351 --> 03:11.020
Mom.

03:11.490 --> 03:12.291
Something urgent came up.

03:12.351 --> 03:13.620
I have to go.

03:13.720 --> 03:15.120
I'll visit you again next time.

03:15.861 --> 03:16.590
Sit down and eat.

03:16.960 --> 03:18.331
Why are you standing there?

03:23.331 --> 03:25.331
You've long known that he's standing outside, didn't you?

03:25.571 --> 03:26.331
Sit down.

03:30.441 --> 03:31.541
I have to go.

03:33.671 --> 03:35.441
Didn't you hear me?

03:36.111 --> 03:37.481
Eat before you go.

03:50.560 --> 03:51.361
Sit down.

03:55.000 --> 03:55.701
Qin Qin.

03:57.560 --> 03:59.000
If you have something urgent to do,

03:59.930 --> 04:00.970
you can go ahead.

04:51.251 --> 04:52.150
Why are you out here?

05:01.261 --> 05:02.331
I lost my appetite.

05:15.141 --> 05:15.840
What's wrong?

05:18.210 --> 05:19.480
I keep thinking about you.

05:24.121 --> 05:25.420
You feel unhappy when you think of me?

05:27.051 --> 05:28.660
Why is your hand so cold?

05:29.920 --> 05:31.360
Is there no heater in the museum?

05:32.391 --> 05:33.061
There is.

05:33.491 --> 05:34.331
It's more than enough.

05:35.460 --> 05:36.400
I just washed my hands.

05:36.730 --> 05:37.801
With cold water.

05:43.040 --> 05:43.701
All right.

05:43.871 --> 05:44.540
Let's go.

05:44.600 --> 05:45.441
It's so cold.

05:48.381 --> 05:49.110
Give me your hand.

05:50.210 --> 05:51.681
It's okay. I'll put it in my pocket.

06:16.770 --> 06:17.600
Don't move.

06:17.970 --> 06:19.011
I'll get mad if you move again.

06:45.600 --> 06:46.301
Wait.

06:48.600 --> 06:49.270
Where are you going?

06:51.241 --> 06:51.970
Home.

06:53.170 --> 06:54.441
Why did you help her?

06:55.610 --> 06:57.410
And in front of all those guests.

06:58.910 --> 07:00.210
Do you want to be like her...

07:00.650 --> 07:01.751
and disobey your parents?

07:02.850 --> 07:03.681
Disobey?

07:06.551 --> 07:07.650
I only blame myself.

07:08.660 --> 07:09.691
I really wish...

07:10.491 --> 07:11.590
I had disobeyed you...

07:12.660 --> 07:14.160
even just once.

07:15.831 --> 07:16.730
What did you say?

07:18.600 --> 07:19.831
I really wish...

07:21.501 --> 07:23.400
our family had never adopted her.

07:25.610 --> 07:26.270
No.

07:31.241 --> 07:32.210
I really wish...

07:34.681 --> 07:36.350
I'd never been your child.

08:09.551 --> 08:11.051
(Loyal to the party, strict discipline, )

08:11.121 --> 08:12.220
Last time, you said...

08:12.290 --> 08:13.290
you'd transfer me.

08:13.920 --> 08:14.891
Is it still on the table?

08:15.121 --> 08:16.391
You finally came around.

08:17.160 --> 08:17.960
Go back quickly,

08:18.121 --> 08:19.691
get all the information ready and submit it.

08:20.960 --> 08:22.061
When is the evaluation?

08:22.761 --> 08:24.801
The organization is still looking into it.

08:25.501 --> 08:26.701
Go back and do a good job.

08:26.801 --> 08:27.871
Wait for the notice.

08:27.931 --> 08:28.600
Yes.

08:29.801 --> 08:30.670
Hold on.

08:32.270 --> 08:33.811
I see...

08:33.871 --> 08:36.581
stars between your eyes.

08:36.780 --> 08:38.280
They're so bright.

08:38.581 --> 08:39.280
Is that so?

08:40.081 --> 08:41.181
Are you getting married?

08:42.120 --> 08:43.081
Are you settling down?

08:45.951 --> 08:46.750
Kid.

08:47.090 --> 08:48.151
That's a good thing.

08:48.220 --> 08:49.990
It's a serious thing.

08:50.161 --> 08:50.960
Good job.

08:51.191 --> 08:52.490
You should've done this sooner.

08:53.730 --> 08:54.390
Go on.

08:54.691 --> 08:55.360
I'll get going.

08:57.161 --> 08:57.831
This...

08:58.230 --> 08:58.970
This doesn't count.

08:59.031 --> 09:00.831
You have to bring wedding candies.

09:00.901 --> 09:01.970
Bring more.

09:02.240 --> 09:03.701
Share it with your comrades.

09:03.771 --> 09:04.470
Okay.

09:04.600 --> 09:05.510
I'll bring more.

09:05.571 --> 09:06.411
Take this back.

09:14.510 --> 09:15.421
Here, have some water.

09:15.551 --> 09:16.220
Thank you.

09:16.451 --> 09:17.151
Xu Qin.

09:17.620 --> 09:18.350
During this time,

09:18.521 --> 09:19.850
you've been working hard...

09:20.090 --> 09:20.850
in the emergency room rotation.

09:20.921 --> 09:21.860
After some time,

09:21.960 --> 09:23.460
you can go back to the Outpatient Department.

09:24.291 --> 09:25.090
However,

09:25.561 --> 09:27.390
the hospital executives still need to discuss...

09:27.791 --> 09:29.531
if you can join the research team or not.

09:30.760 --> 09:32.630
The research team is run by the department head...

09:32.701 --> 09:33.771
and the professor.

09:33.901 --> 09:35.671
Why do you need to discuss it with hospital executives?

09:37.970 --> 09:39.340
I'll be honest with you.

09:40.171 --> 09:41.171
This spot...

09:41.240 --> 09:42.081
is supposed to be yours.

09:42.411 --> 09:43.610
But because of what you told...

09:43.840 --> 09:45.850
the patient on the rooftop last time...

09:46.210 --> 09:47.151
was inappropriate,

09:47.210 --> 09:48.250
the executives think...

09:48.480 --> 09:49.921
it's damaging to our hospital's image.

09:50.521 --> 09:51.990
So while the issue isn't over yet,

09:52.051 --> 09:53.421
you need to lie low for a while.

09:53.521 --> 09:54.421
But don't worry.

09:54.750 --> 09:56.691
I'm sure there will be other opportunities in the future.

09:58.291 --> 10:00.061
I've already searched for that issue online.

10:00.130 --> 10:01.331
It was resolved peacefully.

10:01.390 --> 10:02.500
There's no rumor at all.

10:04.831 --> 10:06.331
Why do the hospital executives suddenly have the time...

10:06.401 --> 10:07.801
to care about a lowly doctor like me?

10:08.901 --> 10:09.840
Even if they do,

10:10.340 --> 10:11.370
on a certain level,

10:11.441 --> 10:12.771
didn't what I do that day...

10:13.340 --> 10:14.970
solve the hospital's problem?

10:17.181 --> 10:18.110
Xu Qin.

10:18.781 --> 10:19.811
After hearing what you said,

10:20.181 --> 10:21.921
I don't know what to say anymore.

10:22.151 --> 10:23.081
If the executives won't approve it,

10:23.151 --> 10:24.551
there's nothing I can do.

10:25.291 --> 10:27.490
Or you can ask them directly.

10:28.760 --> 10:29.661
The department's problems...

10:29.720 --> 10:30.760
must be resolved within the department.

10:31.061 --> 10:32.291
You're my boss.

10:32.460 --> 10:33.390
Why would I overstep?

10:33.460 --> 10:34.130
Well...

10:34.191 --> 10:34.890
Dr. Tian.

10:36.031 --> 10:38.000
Let me clarify my position first.

10:38.831 --> 10:39.901
If you don't choose me,

10:40.130 --> 10:41.801
please give me an appropriate reason.

10:42.140 --> 10:43.401
Did I make a mistake...

10:43.470 --> 10:44.541
or break some rules?

10:45.071 --> 10:45.941
Are my exam results...

10:46.010 --> 10:47.171
lower than the other doctors?

10:47.240 --> 10:48.140
Or...

10:48.210 --> 10:49.980
didn't I do my job as well as other doctors?

10:50.411 --> 10:52.250
As for that ridiculous reason just now,

10:52.380 --> 10:53.210
I don't accept it.

10:53.911 --> 11:01.651
(Build reputation with service, treat patients with priority)

11:19.640 --> 11:20.470
Hurry up.

11:22.710 --> 11:23.681
Lower. Lower your center of gravity.

11:23.911 --> 11:25.140
Your center of gravity. Lower your center of gravity.

11:25.210 --> 11:26.281
Lower your center of gravity.

11:26.710 --> 11:27.380
Good.

11:35.620 --> 11:36.360
Not bad.

11:36.521 --> 11:37.990
Jiang Yi, round them up.

11:38.061 --> 11:38.791
Everyone is here.

11:38.860 --> 11:39.561
Assemble.

11:41.901 --> 11:42.901
- Liu Wei. - Present.

11:43.031 --> 11:44.161
With Liu Wei as the center,

11:44.230 --> 11:45.600
align to the center.

11:48.431 --> 11:49.671
Eyes front.

11:50.201 --> 11:51.140
Thank you for your hard work.

11:51.201 --> 11:51.870
Have some water.

11:51.941 --> 11:53.171
- Hello, Instructor. - Hi, Instructor.

11:53.870 --> 11:54.771
Okay. Thank the Instructor.

11:54.840 --> 11:56.081
- Thank you, Instructor. - Thank you, Instructor.

11:57.811 --> 11:58.610
Where's Chief?

11:58.681 --> 12:00.010
The branch director wanted to see him.

12:01.210 --> 12:01.921
Instructor.

12:02.051 --> 12:03.220
I heard Chief is going to be transferred.

12:03.281 --> 12:03.951
Is that true?

12:04.421 --> 12:05.590
Wait. Is he really leaving?

12:05.651 --> 12:06.691
Wait, Yang Chi. Why is he leaving?

12:06.750 --> 12:08.661
If Chief is gone, what should we do, Yang Chi?

12:08.860 --> 12:09.561
It's not decided yet.

12:09.620 --> 12:10.890
Don't be anxious.

12:11.120 --> 12:12.291
I still don't want him to leave.

12:12.730 --> 12:13.931
This is too sudden.

12:14.590 --> 12:15.460
It's not your concern.

12:15.531 --> 12:16.201
Train hard.

12:16.301 --> 12:16.960
Carry on.

12:17.100 --> 12:17.960
All right, Instructor.

12:19.970 --> 12:20.701
- Yang Chi... - It's okay.

12:20.771 --> 12:22.740
- Have some water. - What do you mean? We...

12:32.781 --> 12:33.911
I'm quite happy for you.

12:34.880 --> 12:35.651
I mean it.

12:36.750 --> 12:37.551
You can't bear for me to leave?

12:38.220 --> 12:39.620
It's not like I won't see you again.

12:44.691 --> 12:46.360
Are you going to let me be the boss?

12:50.000 --> 12:51.031
You have to be good then.

12:51.401 --> 12:52.531
Save it.

13:03.240 --> 13:04.110
Are you surprised?

13:06.581 --> 13:07.681
Not really.

13:09.281 --> 13:10.350
I always felt...

13:11.350 --> 13:12.551
that since you love Shilitai so much,

13:13.291 --> 13:15.090
you would never leave this place.

13:16.090 --> 13:17.120
But then again,

13:17.860 --> 13:18.960
you're so capable.

13:19.661 --> 13:21.130
You deserve to be in a higher...

13:21.191 --> 13:22.331
and better position.

13:24.360 --> 13:25.801
Anyway, you didn't leave firefighting.

13:30.941 --> 13:31.671
What's wrong?

13:35.171 --> 13:36.010
Nothing.

13:37.880 --> 13:38.640
Thank you.

13:39.581 --> 13:40.380
You're thanking me?

13:44.120 --> 13:45.250
Thank you for supporting me...

13:46.120 --> 13:47.090
and understanding me.

14:11.041 --> 14:12.110
I'm sorry, Dr. Tian.

14:12.181 --> 14:12.980
I can't sign this.

14:13.051 --> 14:14.010
I don't agree either.

14:15.521 --> 14:16.181
Dr. Xu.

14:16.850 --> 14:18.651
Aren't you putting me in a difficult position?

14:18.720 --> 14:19.921
I'm not giving you a hard time.

14:20.151 --> 14:21.051
Among these people,

14:21.120 --> 14:22.460
Dr. Xu is the most qualified.

14:23.120 --> 14:23.791
As for the rest,

14:23.960 --> 14:24.860
I wouldn't agree...

14:25.120 --> 14:26.360
to anyone you choose.

14:29.901 --> 14:31.161
How strange.

14:31.401 --> 14:32.171
Dr. Xu.

14:32.431 --> 14:35.000
Haven't you always disliked Dr. Xu before?

14:35.600 --> 14:37.740
Whether I dislike her or not is my business.

14:37.941 --> 14:39.171
Whether Dr. Xu is capable of this job or not...

14:39.240 --> 14:40.411
is her business.

14:42.781 --> 14:43.510
Let me ask you.

14:43.811 --> 14:45.980
Dr. Xu is such a qualified doctor.

14:46.250 --> 14:47.651
Why did you remove her?

14:48.821 --> 14:49.720
Dr. Xu.

14:50.220 --> 14:51.720
Why are you so stubborn?

14:52.151 --> 14:53.521
This isn't my idea.

14:54.250 --> 14:55.220
The higher-ups told me...

14:55.661 --> 14:57.291
not to let Dr. Xu join for now.

14:57.860 --> 14:58.960
The higher-ups told you?

14:59.191 --> 15:00.260
Who?

15:02.630 --> 15:03.600
Mr. Liu.

15:07.171 --> 15:07.931
Him again?

15:10.140 --> 15:11.500
I think he has been a bureaucrat for too long.

15:11.571 --> 15:13.171
He doesn't even know if the heart is on the left or on the right.

15:13.571 --> 15:14.541
This is a hospital.

15:14.640 --> 15:15.610
It's not a bureaucrat's office.

15:16.380 --> 15:18.441
Can matters of life and death be dealt with so ridiculously?

15:19.010 --> 15:20.750
Dr. Xu, listen to me.

15:20.811 --> 15:21.811
Don't try to persuade me.

15:22.451 --> 15:23.281
Let me tell you.

15:23.480 --> 15:25.021
It's rare to find good talent.

15:25.081 --> 15:26.321
I have to protect her.

15:26.651 --> 15:28.350
If you don't choose her, I won't choose anyone.

15:28.720 --> 15:29.960
It's fine even if our department can't be continued.

15:31.720 --> 15:32.661
Dr. Xu.

15:33.490 --> 15:35.161
Mr. Liu is putting pressure on me.

15:35.600 --> 15:36.701
Tell me what I should do.

15:36.760 --> 15:37.831
That's your problem.

15:37.901 --> 15:39.301
Solve it yourself then.

15:39.370 --> 15:40.500
Why talk to me?

15:41.031 --> 15:42.541
I've already made my position very clear.

15:42.600 --> 15:43.870
Report my position...

15:43.941 --> 15:45.640
to Mr. Liu, okay?

15:45.771 --> 15:46.610
Dr. Xu.

16:17.801 --> 16:20.671
(Mom, are you interfering with my job?)

16:23.840 --> 16:25.010
(Please don't do that.)

16:53.911 --> 16:57.041
(I didn't ask for the family's help when I joined the hospital before.)

17:06.951 --> 17:08.250
(I didn't ask for the family's help when I joined the hospital before.)

17:08.321 --> 17:12.961
(I got in by relying on my own capability.)

17:13.031 --> 17:14.690
(Please don't do this kind of thing.)

17:20.900 --> 17:25.640
(Then...)

17:38.650 --> 17:42.090
(Then rely on yourself to get promoted.)

17:46.930 --> 17:52.301
(Okay, I will.)

18:12.551 --> 18:13.350
Hello, Feng Bei.

18:16.261 --> 18:17.090
Okay, I'm coming.

18:25.670 --> 18:28.331
(Serve Yancheng, very disciplined, wise and brave in fighting)

18:41.711 --> 18:42.850
What are you doing?

18:43.620 --> 18:44.281
What are you two doing?

18:44.350 --> 18:45.251
You scared me.

18:45.321 --> 18:46.491
You're dressed so fashionably.

18:46.690 --> 18:47.850
Where are you going?

18:49.120 --> 18:50.390
I'm going to the movies.

18:50.660 --> 18:51.721
I'm cultivating my emotions.

18:51.791 --> 18:54.061
It's rare for us to get a half-day off.

18:54.190 --> 18:55.261
Aren't we going to play an Arranged Team game?

18:55.331 --> 18:56.700
Can we do it another day?

18:57.160 --> 18:58.360
Learn from me.

18:58.430 --> 18:59.731
Get some fresh air.

18:59.801 --> 19:01.400
Don't just stay in the dorm and play games.

19:02.600 --> 19:04.600
I think there's something going on with you.

19:06.741 --> 19:07.571
Da Peng.

19:07.971 --> 19:09.880
You're not going on a date, are you?

19:12.910 --> 19:13.711
Keep it a secret for me.

19:14.581 --> 19:16.221
I'll treat you to milk tea and barbecue when I get back, okay?

19:16.321 --> 19:17.251
That's more like it.

19:17.321 --> 19:18.221
Go on.

19:18.551 --> 19:19.221
You can do it.

19:19.491 --> 19:20.321
- Be careful. - Go.

19:20.491 --> 19:21.190
Keep it a secret.

19:21.251 --> 19:22.321
- Okay. - Don't worry.

19:34.831 --> 19:35.501
Dong Dong.

19:36.370 --> 19:38.241
Da Peng, what are you doing here?

19:39.241 --> 19:39.940
I...

19:40.471 --> 19:41.741
You must be here to see Ms. Nan, are you?

19:42.241 --> 19:43.380
I'll take a look for you.

19:43.811 --> 19:44.511
Thank you.

19:44.581 --> 19:45.311
No problem.

19:56.690 --> 19:57.491
Ms. Nan.

19:57.690 --> 19:59.291
Zhan Da Peng is here.

20:00.090 --> 20:01.231
It's time for you to get off work.

20:01.291 --> 20:02.731
He's waiting outside.

20:03.160 --> 20:03.831
Okay.

20:04.400 --> 20:05.061
All right.

20:05.130 --> 20:05.900
I'm done.

20:05.971 --> 20:06.731
Here you go.

20:07.001 --> 20:08.301
Hurry up.

20:08.571 --> 20:10.670
What if a nurse from another department targets him?

20:10.741 --> 20:11.700
What would you do?

20:11.771 --> 20:13.170
- That's right. What would you do? - Go.

20:13.241 --> 20:14.311
Stop being a busybody.

20:14.370 --> 20:15.271
Hurry up.

20:15.340 --> 20:16.380
I got it.

20:25.751 --> 20:29.360
(Zhan Da Peng)

20:34.961 --> 20:35.630
Jun Ping.

20:36.001 --> 20:36.961
Freshly roasted sweet potatoes.

20:38.130 --> 20:39.501
Yang Chi, Pi Pi.

20:40.001 --> 20:40.771
Freshly roasted sweet potatoes.

20:40.831 --> 20:41.501
Here.

20:41.571 --> 20:43.501
- You can eat first. I'll eat later. - Be careful, it's hot.

20:43.571 --> 20:44.600
- Thank you, Jiang Yi. - Thank you, Jiang Yi.

20:49.180 --> 20:49.880
Ge Zheng.

20:50.981 --> 20:51.640
What's up, Yang Chi?

20:51.910 --> 20:52.981
Come and have some roasted sweet potatoes.

20:53.150 --> 20:53.811
Here.

20:53.880 --> 20:54.680
I'm good, Yang Chi.

20:55.380 --> 20:56.051
My girlfriend is here.

20:58.281 --> 20:59.251
Are you the only one with a girlfriend?

20:59.521 --> 21:01.150
If Xu Xi isn't busy lately...

21:02.120 --> 21:02.961
Let's take a look.

21:03.160 --> 21:03.821
Let's go.

21:06.991 --> 21:08.461
Ge Zheng!

21:14.001 --> 21:14.971
Why are you in such a hurry?

21:15.031 --> 21:17.001
Look at how inexperienced you look.

21:17.741 --> 21:18.541
Are you envious?

21:19.170 --> 21:19.940
- I am. - Yang Chi.

21:20.011 --> 21:20.670
Have some sweet potatoes.

21:21.541 --> 21:23.581
Ge Zheng, stop being lovey-dovey.

21:23.680 --> 21:24.880
Who are you showing it to by the gate?

21:25.511 --> 21:26.511
Do what you have to do.

21:27.380 --> 21:28.051
Hurry up and leave.

21:28.110 --> 21:29.521
If you don't leave now, we might get a mission and you can't leave.

21:30.021 --> 21:31.821
You're always such a jinx.

21:35.491 --> 21:37.721
The sweet potato is suddenly not that good anymore.

21:38.561 --> 21:39.261
Are you not eating it?

21:39.531 --> 21:40.331
Give it to me then.

21:48.130 --> 21:48.801
Ms. Nan.

21:51.140 --> 21:51.801
Are you off work?

21:54.541 --> 21:55.571
Are you tired today?

21:57.880 --> 21:59.410
I bought movie tickets for 7:30pm.

21:59.581 --> 22:01.081
We can have dinner before watching a movie.

22:01.450 --> 22:02.251
Additional screening of "The Bravest".

22:02.311 --> 22:02.981
I'm not free.

22:03.051 --> 22:04.021
I have a family matter to attend to.

22:04.521 --> 22:06.850
Wait. Didn't you say that we...

22:07.090 --> 22:08.650
That was then, not now.

22:09.190 --> 22:11.061
Things change every day and so do people.

22:13.991 --> 22:14.791
It's okay.

22:14.961 --> 22:16.360
Let's watch it together...

22:16.561 --> 22:17.331
when you're free.

22:17.930 --> 22:18.600
Bye.

22:19.700 --> 22:20.600
I'll walk you out.

22:20.971 --> 22:22.430
It's okay. I'm going to the bus stop.

22:23.471 --> 22:24.801
I'll walk you to the bus stop then.

22:31.140 --> 22:31.910
Da Peng.

22:32.410 --> 22:33.511
Walk with me then.

22:34.811 --> 22:35.481
Sure.

22:48.731 --> 22:49.400
Da Peng.

22:55.801 --> 22:57.640
Let's not see each other again.

23:00.741 --> 23:02.011
Did I do something wrong?

23:04.481 --> 23:05.140
No.

23:07.011 --> 23:08.011
Did I put you in a difficult position...

23:08.211 --> 23:09.110
by coming to see you?

23:13.150 --> 23:14.051
I got it.

23:14.350 --> 23:15.821
What's troubling you...

23:15.890 --> 23:16.791
is that I'm younger than you.

23:17.690 --> 23:19.120
I'm 22 years old now.

23:19.390 --> 23:21.461
I'm already at the legal age for marriage.

23:21.761 --> 23:23.231
I'm old enough to have a family, you know.

23:23.430 --> 23:24.461
We're not compatible.

23:24.531 --> 23:25.831
How so?

23:26.170 --> 23:27.271
We're not even together yet.

23:27.331 --> 23:28.430
How are we not compatible?

23:29.870 --> 23:31.200
I'm so much older than you.

23:32.071 --> 23:33.471
Your parents won't approve.

23:34.170 --> 23:35.910
What does this have to do with my parents?

23:36.410 --> 23:37.140
If I like you,

23:37.211 --> 23:38.811
my parents will naturally like you.

23:42.481 --> 23:43.450
It all boils down to one thing.

23:43.680 --> 23:44.821
You still see me as a kid.

23:46.021 --> 23:46.950
I'm serious.

23:47.291 --> 23:48.521
I want to date you.

23:50.190 --> 23:50.991
Tell me.

23:51.491 --> 23:52.461
In which aspect am I not good?

23:52.521 --> 23:53.561
I can work hard to fix it.

23:53.961 --> 23:55.130
When I first joined the fire station,

23:55.190 --> 23:56.061
it was the same.

23:56.360 --> 23:57.501
I had a lot of problems during training.

23:57.801 --> 23:59.331
The chief and the others looked down on me.

23:59.400 --> 24:00.930
But later on, through my own hard work,

24:01.001 --> 24:02.670
I became an outstanding firefighter.

24:03.340 --> 24:04.870
I even want to be an all-rounder.

24:04.940 --> 24:06.910
Training is different from dating.

24:06.971 --> 24:07.971
It's the same.

24:09.880 --> 24:11.180
At least the attitude is the same.

24:31.630 --> 24:32.430
Ms. Nan.

24:36.241 --> 24:37.741
Let me think about it again then.

24:38.771 --> 24:40.741
Okay, think about it.

24:42.440 --> 24:44.180
I'll see you again next week then.

24:45.081 --> 24:46.211
Wait for my call.

24:58.461 --> 24:59.390
I accept your test.

25:00.291 --> 25:01.561
I'll wait for your good news.

25:13.640 --> 25:14.471
Guys.

25:14.771 --> 25:17.081
Let's celebrate the completion of Junguang Square.

25:17.311 --> 25:18.180
Are you ready?

25:18.241 --> 25:19.241
- Yes. - Yes.

25:19.311 --> 25:20.281
Light it up!

25:32.731 --> 25:33.991
You're really something, Mr. Wang.

25:55.410 --> 25:57.081
Fire.

25:57.450 --> 25:58.120
Foreman.

25:58.420 --> 25:59.521
One of the floors is on fire.

26:01.090 --> 26:01.751
Hurry!

26:01.890 --> 26:02.860
Call the firemen!

26:02.920 --> 26:03.721
Hurry up!

26:09.501 --> 26:10.160
Hurry!

26:21.971 --> 26:22.640
Hurry.

26:25.011 --> 26:27.850
(Serve Yancheng, very disciplined, wise and brave in fighting)

26:37.991 --> 26:40.130
There's a fire on the upper floors of Junguang Square construction.

26:40.190 --> 26:40.890
The fire is huge.

26:40.961 --> 26:41.630
People are trapped.

26:41.690 --> 26:42.731
Wufang Street Fire and Rescue Station.

26:42.801 --> 26:43.761
Shilitai Fire and Rescue Station.

26:43.831 --> 26:44.930
All squads and teams, get ready for battle.

26:45.600 --> 26:46.630
Copy that.

27:13.660 --> 27:15.061
Squad Two, get the water hoses ready.

27:15.130 --> 27:16.200
Wait for the chief's order.

27:16.400 --> 27:18.031
Staff from the headquarters are on their way.

27:18.100 --> 27:19.261
I've already sent in my men.

27:19.331 --> 27:20.170
What's the situation?

27:20.231 --> 27:21.971
The foreman said eight workers are trapped.

27:22.031 --> 27:22.700
What are their specific locations?

27:22.771 --> 27:23.801
On the 8th to 12th floor.

27:23.971 --> 27:25.301
I'll take some men to cover the 8th to 10th floors.

27:25.370 --> 27:26.940
You take men to the 11th to 12th floors.

27:27.170 --> 27:27.840
Okay.

27:32.440 --> 27:33.811
Pi Pi, Zhan Da Peng, Ge Zheng.

27:35.051 --> 27:35.711
- Present! - Present!

27:36.011 --> 27:36.821
Yang Chi, Jiang Yi.

27:37.081 --> 27:37.950
Come with me to save them.

27:38.081 --> 27:38.751
- Got it. - Got it.

28:04.711 --> 28:05.410
Be careful.

28:38.511 --> 28:40.311
- Yang Chi, go upstairs. - Okay.

28:40.380 --> 28:41.610
Pi Pi, Da Peng, come with me.

28:41.680 --> 28:42.350
- Yes. - Yes.

29:00.531 --> 29:01.400
No water.

29:02.771 --> 29:03.600
Abandon hose.

29:03.801 --> 29:04.940
The fire hydrant has no water.

29:05.340 --> 29:06.370
Roger that.

29:06.741 --> 29:07.541
Pi Pi, Da Peng.

29:07.610 --> 29:08.410
Abandon hose.

29:08.471 --> 29:09.170
Be careful.

29:09.440 --> 29:10.110
- Roger that. - Copy that.

29:10.910 --> 29:11.840
Abandon hose.

29:12.011 --> 29:12.680
Let's go.

29:15.950 --> 29:16.781
Go.

30:05.231 --> 30:05.930
Be careful.

30:09.100 --> 30:10.170
Ge Zheng, are you okay?

30:10.440 --> 30:11.370
I'm fine.

30:14.041 --> 30:14.711
Let's go.

31:09.360 --> 31:10.031
Da Peng.

31:10.100 --> 31:10.801
There's someone up ahead.

31:18.640 --> 31:19.301
Are you okay?

31:19.640 --> 31:20.340
Is there anyone else in there?

31:20.410 --> 31:21.640
There's someone else in there.

31:22.340 --> 31:23.180
Where?

31:23.241 --> 31:24.311
Over there?

31:29.450 --> 31:30.620
Help.

31:32.450 --> 31:33.850
Yang Chi, I'll go take a look.

31:34.690 --> 31:35.920
Is anyone there?

31:47.200 --> 31:48.400
Is anyone there?

31:50.771 --> 31:52.071
Help.

31:56.140 --> 31:56.811
Wake up.

31:57.041 --> 31:57.711
Wake up.

31:57.981 --> 31:59.041
Can you move?

32:10.860 --> 32:12.261
Wake up. Get up.

32:12.561 --> 32:13.630
I'll get you out of here.

32:13.690 --> 32:14.590
Get up.

32:36.620 --> 32:37.620
There's a flashover.

32:38.850 --> 32:40.251
Everyone, fall back.

32:40.321 --> 32:41.120
Fall back!

33:05.110 --> 33:05.781
Chief.

33:05.840 --> 33:07.180
Chief, reply if you copy.

33:12.150 --> 33:12.880
Ge Zheng.

33:13.120 --> 33:13.950
Are you okay?

33:14.021 --> 33:15.620
I'm fine, Chief.

33:22.261 --> 33:23.761
Are you okay? Can you move?

33:24.831 --> 33:25.630
Chief.

33:25.900 --> 33:27.400
There's someone trapped here.

33:35.771 --> 33:36.581
Chief.

33:37.211 --> 33:38.041
Are you okay?

33:38.281 --> 33:39.081
I'm fine.

33:47.751 --> 33:48.690
Styrofoam.

33:52.190 --> 33:52.860
Yang Chi.

33:53.331 --> 33:53.991
Present.

33:54.061 --> 33:55.331
- Pi Pi. - Present.

33:55.390 --> 33:56.160
Da Peng.

33:58.900 --> 33:59.561
Let's search upstairs.

33:59.801 --> 34:00.571
Come on, Jiang Yi.

34:00.630 --> 34:01.501
Let's go.

34:31.930 --> 34:32.700
Da Peng.

34:33.030 --> 34:33.970
Da Peng.

34:34.030 --> 34:34.771
Chief.

34:34.831 --> 34:36.001
Have you found Da Peng?

34:36.600 --> 34:37.271
Not yet.

34:43.910 --> 34:44.611
Chief.

34:45.311 --> 34:46.651
It's Da Peng's helmet.

35:46.200 --> 35:47.541
Da Peng!

35:50.780 --> 35:52.510
- Doctor! - Doctor!

35:52.581 --> 35:53.910
- Doctor! - Doctor!

35:54.050 --> 35:54.850
Doctor!

35:59.850 --> 36:00.950
Doctor!

36:01.120 --> 36:01.820
Doctor!

36:02.620 --> 36:03.291
- Hurry! - Hurry!

36:03.660 --> 36:04.320
Hurry!

36:04.591 --> 36:05.660
Da Peng!

36:05.720 --> 36:08.030
- Da Peng! - Da Peng!

36:08.091 --> 36:08.831
Back to your posts.

36:08.890 --> 36:09.791
- Back to your posts. - Okay.

36:10.030 --> 36:10.861
Block them.

36:10.930 --> 36:12.030
Don't let the new team members see this.

36:12.100 --> 36:12.760
Okay.

36:12.831 --> 36:13.731
Back to your posts.

36:13.800 --> 36:14.930
The fire is still burning. Hurry!

36:15.001 --> 36:16.401
- Da Peng! - Da Peng!

36:16.470 --> 36:17.140
Back to your posts.

36:17.200 --> 36:17.870
Yang Chi.

36:17.941 --> 36:18.740
How's Da Peng?

36:19.041 --> 36:20.001
Go back to your posts!

36:20.240 --> 36:20.970
Go back.

36:25.510 --> 36:26.180
Hurry.

36:26.240 --> 36:27.010
Go back to your posts.

36:27.081 --> 36:28.280
- Jiang Yi. - Go back.

36:28.350 --> 36:29.081
Jiang Yi.

36:29.151 --> 36:30.251
Go with him to the hospital.

36:30.521 --> 36:31.620
Do whatever it takes.

36:33.180 --> 36:33.850
Okay.

36:40.791 --> 36:41.461
Hurry!

36:41.530 --> 36:42.331
Go!

36:42.461 --> 36:43.501
(Ambulance)

37:26.041 --> 37:29.111
- Hang in there, Da Peng. - It hurts.

37:29.171 --> 37:31.010
You're the strongest in the team.

37:31.381 --> 37:32.180
We're almost at the hospital.

37:32.240 --> 37:33.041
Hang in there.

37:37.220 --> 37:38.381
I'm here.

37:38.450 --> 37:40.251
I'm here with you, Da Peng.

37:44.160 --> 37:44.820
Sir!

37:45.061 --> 37:46.120
Drive faster.

37:46.760 --> 37:47.890
I'm currently at the scene of the fire...

37:48.091 --> 37:50.760
at Junguang Square's construction site.

37:51.800 --> 37:53.570
A perimeter is already set up behind me.

37:54.800 --> 37:55.700
As of now,

37:56.331 --> 37:58.070
the fire has caused eight minor injuries...

37:58.140 --> 37:58.941
and five serious injuries,

37:59.771 --> 38:01.441
including a firefighter.

38:01.611 --> 38:03.140
The injured have already been rushed...

38:03.211 --> 38:04.581
to a nearby hospital.

38:04.640 --> 38:06.441
The fire is still being extinguished.

38:06.811 --> 38:09.111
I hope our firefighters can protect themselves...

38:09.251 --> 38:11.350
while putting out the fire.

38:33.910 --> 38:34.771
(Exit)

38:38.581 --> 38:39.841
Our firefighter is injured.

38:39.981 --> 38:40.651
Where is he?

38:40.711 --> 38:41.850
Is it the firefighter earlier?

38:41.910 --> 38:42.611
Yes.

38:42.811 --> 38:43.481
- Song Yan. - Check it.

38:45.251 --> 38:45.950
I saw on the news...

38:46.021 --> 38:47.050
that someone from the fire department was injured.

38:47.120 --> 38:48.050
Is he one of you?

38:48.220 --> 38:48.921
It's Da Peng.

38:49.320 --> 38:50.120
Who took the case?

38:50.361 --> 38:51.061
Dr. Yang Si Jia.

38:51.120 --> 38:52.061
She's in Operating Room 3.

38:52.120 --> 38:52.921
Come with me.

39:13.111 --> 39:14.410
I kept calling you. Why didn't you pick up?

39:17.850 --> 39:18.620
Say something!

39:33.700 --> 39:34.501
I'm very sorry.

39:35.331 --> 39:36.331
His injury was too severe.

39:37.001 --> 39:38.740
We did everything we could to save him.

39:48.251 --> 39:48.910
You guys...

39:51.280 --> 39:52.421
should come in and see him.
